    "story": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "One story, two chapters",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>EvlveX began with one idea: falling behind is not the end; sometimes, it is where the comeback begins. COMEBACK is about what happens after life knocks you down: the strength to keep going, the courage to move forward, and the choice to become someone new.</p><p>Our first collection tells that story in two chapters, one for each model. Every pair carries the EvlveX monogram, a number of its own, and a certificate registered to the person who wears it.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "full_width": false,
        "padding_top": 96,
        "padding_bottom": 80
      }
    },
    "atelier": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "caption": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
