        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The moment after the struggle, when you stop looking back and choose what comes next. Carry the lessons forward, leave the weight behind, and take the first step into a new chapter. In cream and sand, with the monogram embossed.</p>",
